+## MCP HTTP compatibility
+
+Streamable HTTP uses the MCP 2026-07-28 stateless contract. Each request is
+independent and carries `Mcp-Protocol-Version`, `Mcp-Method`, and the applicable
+request metadata; Compass neither issues nor requires `Mcp-Session-Id`.
+`server/discover` replaces the HTTP initialize/session handshake. The stdio
+transport retains its separately qualified protocol compatibility.
